    },
    {
     "title": "IMPROVEMENTS",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Implemented a function to disable camera shake when walking. To activate go to: OPTIONS MENU/ACCESSIBILITY/CAMERA SHAKE, turn it on/off.",
